Software Requirements Specification (SRS) & Roadmap: Aegis-Val Framework

1. Executive Summary & Vision

1.1 Document Overview

This document specifies the software requirements and strategic roadmap for Aegis-Val, an enterprise-grade, world-class AI Validation and Governance Framework. Aegis-Val is designed to transition organizations from deterministic software QA paradigms to continuous, probabilistic AI system validation.

1.2 System Vision

Aegis-Val acts as an end-to-end quality, security, and compliance wrapper for large language models, agentic workflows, and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) pipelines. It operationalizes advanced evaluation workflows like Critique Shadowing, enforces low-latency runtime safety via adaptive guardrail architectures, and automatically compiles audit-ready regulatory artifacts for global compliance frameworks.

